# Q4: Redis key-value student information system
# Open redis-cli and enter these commands one by one.

# 1-2. Store at least five students (student ID is the key)
SET student:1 "Aanya"
SET student:2 "Riya"
SET student:3 "Rahul"
SET student:4 "Priya"
SET student:5 "Aman"

# 3. Retrieve a student using the key
GET student:3

# 4. Update a student's value
SET student:3 "Rahul Sharma"
GET student:3

# 5. Delete a student
DEL student:5

# 6. Display all student keys
KEYS student:*
